\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces Multi-layer MLA reconstruction stacking (bs=1, 16\nobreakspace  {}MB/layer, graph-timed). Stacking 1--6 layers sweeps the per-step working set from 16 to 96\nobreakspace  {}MB; the FP16$\to $W8A8 crossover occurs between two and three layers (32$\to $48\nobreakspace  {}MB), bracketing the measured $C_\text  {eff}\approx 36$\nobreakspace  {}MB. Dashed: CARM FP16 prediction.\relax }}{15}{figure.caption.71}\protected@file@percent }
